                "message": "Add a grouped backlinks sidebar that follows the main note\n\nsp-vulpea-grouped-backlinks-sidebar toggles a side window next to the\nvulpea-ui sidebar. It redraws when the main window shows another note,\nusing the same main window and note lookup as vulpea-ui. The follow\ntoggle (sp-vulpea-grouped-backlinks-sidebar-toggle-follow) only affects\nthis sidebar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAyV71uz259d2Xv3kV",
